      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target for Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers from ₹3,026 to ₹2,660, citing updated assumptions on revenue growth, profit margins, a higher discount rate, and a revised future P/E multiple. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on April 28, 2026, to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, and to recommend a final dividend for FY 2025-26, if any (company filing).",
