      "body": "After last week's 17% share price gain to ₹2,305, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 31x. Average forward P/E is 38x in the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 407% over the past three years. Simply Wall St's valuation model estimates the intrinsic value at ₹1,557 per share.",
